{
  "date": "2026-11-23",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "鲲鹏支付：商户刷卡的钱晚到账，争取12月底前全部结算",
  "title_en": "Kunpeng Payment: merchants' card payments arrived late; it aims to settle everything before the end of December",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "重庆一家支付公司“鲲鹏支付”11月20日发布公告说，一些商户用它的POS机刷卡收款以后，钱没有按时到账。这已经是这家公司第三次公开说明这件事。",
      "en": "Kunpeng Payment, a payment company in Chongqing, said in an announcement on November 20 that after some merchants took card payments on its POS terminals, the money did not arrive in their accounts on time. This is the third time the company has publicly explained the matter."
    },
    {
      "zh": "11月4日，鲲鹏支付第一次承认结算推迟了，并向商户道歉。公司说，原因是自己在清算、出款和风险管理上做得不够。11月7日，公司又说，有关部门已经成立了专门的工作组，监督公司把每一笔交易都检查一遍。",
      "en": "On November 4, Kunpeng Payment first admitted that settlement had been delayed and apologised to merchants. The company said the reason was that it had not done enough in clearing, payouts and risk management. On November 7, the company said the relevant authorities had set up a special working group to supervise it as it checked every single transaction."
    },
    {
      "zh": "公司这次表示，从11月9日起，真实、合法的交易已经开始结算，很多商户已经陆续收到钱。从11月20日开始，公司会检查还没有结算的其他资金，争取在12月底以前全部完成。",
      "en": "This time the company said that since November 9, real and legal transactions have started to be settled, and many merchants have gradually received their money. Starting November 20, the company will check the other funds that have not yet been settled, and it aims to finish everything before the end of December."
    },
    {
      "zh": "鲲鹏支付在2011年从中国人民银行拿到支付牌照，提供银行卡收单、移动支付和网络支付等服务，牌照的有效期到2026年12月21日。公司还提醒商户：结算不收任何费用，如果有人说交钱就能更快拿到钱，不要相信。",
      "en": "Kunpeng Payment received its payment licence from the People's Bank of China in 2011. It provides bank card acquiring, mobile payment and online payment services, and its licence is valid until December 21, 2026. The company also reminded merchants that settlement is free of charge: if someone says paying money will get your funds faster, don't believe them."
    }
  ],
